message: "Please cite the fixed proof commit. This Lean 4 formalization is conditional on four published mathematical theorems."
title: "ErdosMahlerLean: Lean 4 formalization of Proposition 2.1 in A counterexample to the Erdős–Mahler conjecture"
type: software
authors:
