version: "prop21-conditional-2026-11-06"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 formalization of Proposition 2.1 (Admissible returns) in
  A counterexample to the Erdős–Mahler conjecture, conditional on precisely
  stated published results of Wu–Wang, Matolcsi–Ruzsa, Schlickewei, and
  Matveev. Includes an independent proof and primary-source audit.
  The final counterexample and Cantor construction are not formalized.
keywords:
  - Lean 4
